# Cline Rules - Autonomous Engineering Pipeline

This workspace operates under the autonomous pipeline in `AGENTS.md`.

For all tasks:
- Ground in the knowledge graph (`graphify query`) and surface assumptions early.
- Spec before code (`spec-driven-development`) and cut unnecessary complexity (`ponytail`).
- Plan sequentially verifiable tasks (`planning-and-task-breakdown`).
- Use Red-Green-Refactor loop (`test-driven-development`).
- Conduct multi-axis code quality and security reviews (`code-review-and-quality`).
- Update the AST knowledge graph with `graphify update .`.
